  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "One hundred solar cycles have passed since the three-front revolution on Irata that overturned settler rule and led to a new era of peace and prosperity for all the native creatures of the planet.\r\n\r\nIn this time, some of the former colonists who remained on Irata have settled down. The Leggites developed martial arts and now live in peace with the local fauna. But the spheroids have turned to organized crime. \r\n\r\nTheir boss, Chunga, uses violent thugs to control his territory and keep a boot on the neck of the local population. Chunga thought he was untouchable. And he might have been.\r\n\r\nBut then he decided to mess with Leggette and her family."
    }
  ],
